v style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;\">#5</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;\">05</div></div><hr style=\"border:0;border-top:1px dashed #cbd5e1;margin:4px 0;\"/><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Description</div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#374151;font-weight:600;\">DO NOT HONOR</div></div></div></div></div>"
